  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - \r\nThe proposed telecommunication equipment, by reason of its siting, scale and appearance would have an unduly harmful impact upon the building itself and the surrounding Green Belt and adjacent Nature Conservation Areas. It would result in harm to the appearance of the area by creating unacceptable visual clutter and an obtrusive, overbearing structure. The proposal is therefore contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development), ENV- B.1.7 (Telecommunications), ENV-N.1.2 (Acceptable Development in the Green Belt) and ENV-N.2.2 (Sites of Regional/Local Nature Conservation) as well as Planning Policy Guidance Note 8.\r\n"
